WEBVTT

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:26.290
<b>Chaika the Coffin Princess</b>

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:27.050
<b>Chaika the Coffin Princess</b>

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:33.730
The Throne That Invites War

00:01:41.190 --> 00:01:42.680
Can you move?

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:45.410
Yeah. We have to get back to the vehicle.

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:47.160
Both of you, come here.

00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:49.630
Let me bite your wounds.

00:01:50.230 --> 00:01:51.710
I can't get to you myself.

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:57.450
So, what do we do now?

00:01:58.730 --> 00:02:02.600
Sneak into the castle and 
nab the remains, or...

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:04.220
Over.

00:02:04.650 --> 00:02:05.570
Huh?

00:02:05.570 --> 00:02:09.270
Lost contest. Collecting remains, over.

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:10.850
Are you serious?

00:02:11.410 --> 00:02:13.940
David, until now, grateful.

00:02:14.350 --> 00:02:16.270
Is that really okay with you?

00:02:16.590 --> 00:02:18.290
What about the remains we have?

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:21.240
Give, to white girl.

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:22.780
Chaika...

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:33.090
Selma! Okay?!

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:38.010
Soldiers came in and... the remains...

00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:41.020
I couldn't protect them. I'm sorry.

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:44.560
Chaika!

00:02:54.970 --> 00:02:55.980
Toru...

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:59.390
White girl, where?

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:01.600
She was taken hostage.

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:05.230
We have to hand over all the 
remains to get her back.

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:07.780
You'd better be careful, too.

00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:17.630
Hey! What are you carrying?

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:20.940
Sir! It's a body that turned 
up during the tournament.

00:03:20.940 --> 00:03:23.640
We were ordered to dispose 
of it outside the castle.

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:24.950
Go.

00:03:32.630 --> 00:03:33.790
Gillette-sama...

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:36.180
These are herbs to stop the pain.

00:03:36.180 --> 00:03:37.070
Please drink.

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:41.160
Can't we do something?

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:44.180
We agreed to rendezvous 
with Leo and Zita here.

00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:46.800
Until then, all we can do is first aid.

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:51.250
We're back.

00:03:55.660 --> 00:03:56.670
You're safe...

00:03:58.210 --> 00:03:59.320
It can't be...

00:03:59.740 --> 00:04:02.530
No... It's impossible...

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:03.620
I know he...

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:05.590
Sorry I worried you.

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:06.930
Gillette-sama!

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:07.950
How?!

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:09.600
Wait. Explanations later.

00:04:09.860 --> 00:04:12.850
Zita, use magic to stop the 
bleeding and infection.

00:04:13.570 --> 00:04:14.600
Right!

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:19.010
It was here, right?

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:20.530
Can you get it?

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:22.900
Yeah.

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:33.620
Are you okay?

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:37.260
Yeah. Once the poison 
wears off, I'll be fine.

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:39.950
I'll be along later. Go on ahead.

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:53.720
Even molting didn't work?

00:04:54.720 --> 00:04:56.350
You know Brother Shin.

00:04:56.910 --> 00:04:59.350
He must've put some nasty poison in her.

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:07.630
Damn it!

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:10.530
What am I doing?

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:13.700
Let's go.

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:31.060
Captain Gillette? Is it true?

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:34.020
<i>Yes. I'm sorry to have worried you.</i>

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:36.570
<i>I'll explain everything later.</i>

00:05:38.130 --> 00:05:41.550
<i>Yes. From my observations,</i>

00:05:41.550 --> 00:05:45.910
King Hartgen organized this martial 
arts tournament in a plot

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:50.700
to gather all the remains for the 
purpose of starting another war.

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:52.700
<i>So it's true...</i>

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:56.930
<i>Did you find out anything about 
the emperor's fortune, the Gundo?</i>

00:05:56.930 --> 00:06:01.420
During the tournament, we came in 
contact with the white Chaika.

00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:07.100
<i>In her words, the Gundo was taken 
by an individual called Guy.</i>

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:09.590
Guy? Who is that?

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:12.230
<i>He seems to be deeply 
involved with the Chaikas,</i>

00:06:12.230 --> 00:06:13.810
<i>but further details are unknown.</i>

00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:16.850
I met him inside the castle.

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:22.820
He handed a girl that he called "the 
emperor's fortune" over to Hartgen.

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:26.500
<i>I did not see her function 
as a weapon myself, however.</i>

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:31.610
It seems this has progressed 
further than I realized.

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:33.030
Remains and a fortune...

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:36.500
Why does Hartgen desire war?

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:39.360
I've brought the white Chaika.

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:48.390
Niva...

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:56.840
I have seen many Chaikas, 
but this is a surprise.

00:06:57.600 --> 00:07:00.230
You look so much like the 
girl I saw back then.

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:07.920
Daughter of the devil, 
do not ask for forgiveness.

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:11.290
Curse and scream all you like as you die!

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:18.250
Memory... Whose?

00:07:20.090 --> 00:07:22.570
The remains are on their way here, yes?

00:07:22.570 --> 00:07:24.290
Yes, sir. They should arrive soon.

00:07:25.510 --> 00:07:27.670
Everything will come together at last...

00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:36.890
Captain Gillette, I am General 
Fyodor of the Wiemac Empire.

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:39.430
<i>It's an honor to speak with you, sir.</i>

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:42.600
I'm told you're currently in 
the Principality of Hartgen?

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:43.430
Yes.

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:47.730
Now that Hartgen's ambitions are 
clear, we cannot ignore him.

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:51.200
<i>We must stop his plans at any cost.</i>

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:52.230
I agree.

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:54.600
<i>The situation is urgent.</i>

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:57.020
<i>Some nations within the alliance 
have formed a conspiracy.</i>

00:07:57.020 --> 00:08:00.060
<i>We've learned that they've 
already deployed a</i>

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:02.210
<i>floating fortress to the 
Principality of Hartgen.</i>

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:07.210
<i>Captain Gillette, I believe 
we must not let go</i>

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:12.240
of this peace that our people have 
finally found after many years of war.

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:14.970
<i>I feel the same, sir.</i>

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:18.830
<i>Many powerful fighters have 
amassed at Goeranson Castle,</i>

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:21.080
<i>virtually smoldering with excess power.</i>

00:08:21.630 --> 00:08:23.880
If the fortune and all the 
remains come together,

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:26.570
their power will pose a threat 
to all in the vicinity.

00:08:27.140 --> 00:08:31.280
<i>Once the floating fortress launches its 
attack, the beast can't be stopped.</i>

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:34.040
<i>Nations within the alliance 
will join the war one by one,</i>

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:36.550
<i>and the entire continent will 
be razed to the ground.</i>

00:08:37.130 --> 00:08:42.120
<i>The only way to prevent it is to stop 
Hartgen's scheme before it manifests.</i>

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:44.770
<i>We will begin preparations 
to march immediately,</i>

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:46.790
<i>but we won't make it in time 
to stop the first contact.</i>

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:49.840
The only ones capable of taking 
action now are the Gillette Squad.

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:52.020
I am gravely aware of the situation.

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:13.820
P-Pardon me!

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:25.160
Take out all your weapons.

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:32.490
Okay. Go in.

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:41.460
Stop.

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:46.980
Are you okay, Chaika?

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:48.100
Yes.

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:49.440
Coffin...

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:52.710
Let Chaika go! I'll give you the remains!

00:09:52.710 --> 00:09:54.370
You promised an exchange, right?

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:58.700
No! No! Don't give remains! Refuse!

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:01.280
Sorry.

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:06.440
No! Refuse! Toru!

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:08.290
Quiet. Show me the inside.

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:26.100
You did well to gather all these.

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:29.190
I knew you would do this.

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:29.950
Step away.

00:10:31.370 --> 00:10:33.220
They are all real, correct?

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:36.070
They're real. There's no mistake.

00:10:36.600 --> 00:10:37.810
Guy...

00:10:37.810 --> 00:10:40.280
So you've been on their side from the start?

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:44.550
My objective is to gather all 
the remains in one place.

00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:48.040
To achieve that, I believe I was 
quite generous in assisting you.

00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:51.470
Especially with regards 
to this superior Chaika.

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:55.020
Let me see them, too.

00:10:58.750 --> 00:10:59.590
That's...

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:01.220
Chaika.

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:03.280
The black Chaika.

00:11:15.760 --> 00:11:17.390
Beautiful...

00:11:17.390 --> 00:11:20.320
White Chaika, you have done good work.

00:11:21.010 --> 00:11:23.750
You are the strongest and 
most formidable of them all.

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:25.240
Please, give back...

00:11:25.420 --> 00:11:29.180
Thank you for your effort. 
Your mission ends here.

00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:31.520
Hey! Let Chaika go right now!

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:35.060
I will have you watch until the very end...

00:11:35.060 --> 00:11:38.840
The true form of Chaika that you 
attempted to become, but failed.

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:40.920
Cut the—

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:41.960
You...

00:11:41.960 --> 00:11:44.440
You want to die in vain? 
Wait for your chance.

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:48.090
Now, let's begin.

00:11:48.090 --> 00:11:51.380
Ilan miril indaril, juri, 
beluvil, delzart...

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:54.410
Come, to rise and hang adrift.

00:11:58.950 --> 00:12:00.740
What do you mean, "begin"?

00:12:01.060 --> 00:12:03.470
The remains gathered by the white one,

00:12:03.470 --> 00:12:05.660
and the one brought by the red one...

00:12:06.170 --> 00:12:09.910
A new history is about to begin.

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:12.870
I see! A new history!

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:16.000
Gaz's remains hold immense power,

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:19.630
and they're all here now, 
along with Gaz's fortune.

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:22.940
Today, I will make the name 
of the taboo emperor mine!

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:26.640
By my own hands, I will call 
forth the era of war once more!

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:29.380
Molle, bagul, elu, eisa, zaldo...

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:35.350
What is this?

00:12:35.950 --> 00:12:37.360
What are you going to do?

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:39.190
I'm going to eat them.

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:39.940
Eat them?

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:44.850
Yes. I've already eaten the 
head and torso that were here.

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:51.750
Delicious...

00:12:52.460 --> 00:12:56.080
How does it feel? 
My father's remains are mine.

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:58.360
I am Chaika Gaz.

00:12:58.360 --> 00:13:01.980
My mission is to bring 
my father back to life.

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:15.310
What are you doing?! Stop!

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:16.400
Chaika!

00:13:19.880 --> 00:13:21.120
Are you jealous?

00:13:21.850 --> 00:13:23.530
Look closely...

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:27.200
At the real Chaika that you 
wished to be, but could not.

00:13:27.720 --> 00:13:28.820
Real...?

00:13:29.180 --> 00:13:31.770
Then grind your teeth in vexation.

00:13:31.770 --> 00:13:36.880
Lament your wretchedness for 
failing to become Chaika...

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:38.830
For failing to complete your 
most important mission!

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:49.820
Man is imperfect.

00:13:49.820 --> 00:13:51.840
However he may seek magic,

00:13:52.410 --> 00:13:54.870
he cannot use it as he wishes.

00:13:55.470 --> 00:13:58.480
He does not possess organs 
of magic in his body.

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:01.690
There is a limit to the 
magic fuel at his disposal.

00:14:02.310 --> 00:14:04.750
Then how can man become perfect?

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:08.710
If he has within him organs 
of magic, like the Fayla,

00:14:08.710 --> 00:14:12.480
and continuously takes in magic fuel 
from all things living in this world,

00:14:12.920 --> 00:14:16.070
he can master all forms 
of magic without limit

00:14:16.070 --> 00:14:19.000
and develop new magical arts.

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:24.300
Father... Father...

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:39.560
Rebirth confirmed. 
Ceasing observation function.

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:55.540
Are you... Guy?

00:14:56.590 --> 00:14:58.310
I am Arthur Gaz...

00:14:58.820 --> 00:15:00.000
The Emperor.

00:15:01.100 --> 00:15:05.000
I have returned to take 
control of the world.

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:08.130
Did he say... Gaz?

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:09.970
Arthur Gaz...

00:15:10.350 --> 00:15:13.140
Are you saying you're the 
reincarnation of Emperor Gaz?

00:15:13.610 --> 00:15:16.040
To acquire a new body,

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:18.940
I died and have been reborn.

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:22.600
I will now reign over this world once again.

00:15:24.580 --> 00:15:27.070
Emperor... Gaz?

00:15:27.720 --> 00:15:29.040
The emperor...

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:33.070
Emperor! I was wrong!

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:38.040
I realized that the world of war you 
created is where true worth lies!

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:40.250
War is the life I am meant to live!

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:43.510
Please, let me walk alongside you!

00:15:43.510 --> 00:15:44.420
Pierce.

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:52.390
Hmm... Not bad.

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:56.900
Our fake father is dead!

00:15:56.900 --> 00:15:59.220
Our real father killed him!

00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:02.650
Father...?

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:03.980
Magic?

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:05.980
Without a Gundo?

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:09.000
Father...

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:09.690
Chaika.

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:12.110
You have done well.

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:14.430
This body satisfies me.

00:16:15.190 --> 00:16:16.370
I'm so glad...

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:19.280
All of you have completed your missions.

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:21.560
My objective has been fulfilled.

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:23.330
Mission...?

00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:25.060
Complete?

00:16:25.060 --> 00:16:27.000
I am not daughter?

00:16:27.450 --> 00:16:29.780
Chaika, only tool?

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:31.880
I have no daughter.

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:37.880
"Chaika" is the generic name for the 
magic devised to bring me back.

00:16:39.110 --> 00:16:41.290
You may call them tools if you wish.

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:45.600
To reconstruct my body,

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:47.580
I chose to die once.

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:56.030
And then I devised magic to bring 
my scattered remains back together.

00:16:58.170 --> 00:17:00.900
A magic technique called "Chaika."

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:06.310
I did it...

00:17:07.220 --> 00:17:10.110
I brought Father back to life...

00:17:11.060 --> 00:17:16.760
Only I was able to place Fayla organs 
in myself and bring Father back.

00:17:17.380 --> 00:17:21.390
The rest of you only gathered 
the remains, like worker bees.

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:24.380
All for me, the queen bee!

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:31.410
You are derivation #357, the wizard type.

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:35.710
You look a great deal like her...

00:17:36.390 --> 00:17:39.240
Like the girl who contributed 
the memories for Chaika.

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:42.520
I kept her by my side for a lark,

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:45.180
but I no longer remember her name.

00:17:45.950 --> 00:17:50.130
There is no longer any way to 
find out who you once were.

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:53.360
You were a magic technique 
that did its job well.

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:03.810
Magic... Me?

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:04.700
Chaika...

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:06.060
Hey!

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:07.720
I wish to ask one question.

00:18:08.430 --> 00:18:11.710
You could have died and been 
reborn within your own castle.

00:18:12.060 --> 00:18:15.190
Why go to the effort of having 
the eight heroes slay you?

00:18:15.690 --> 00:18:20.060
I chose to be killed in order to 
plant a powerful feeling in me:

00:18:20.060 --> 00:18:22.230
the fear of death.

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:25.200
I had myself cut apart and 
gathered by the Chaikas

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:28.710
so that they would fight among 
themselves and foster hostility.

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:30.110
Cut the crap!

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:32.490
Anger... Very good.

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:37.920
Rich, intense emotions and 
memories are ideal for magic.

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:42.820
You all must awaken to the 
murderous intent within you.

00:18:42.820 --> 00:18:45.380
This is a good opportunity, 
so I will tell you

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:49.490
what you should do in order to 
effectively obtain rich emotions.

00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:50.850
What?

00:18:51.070 --> 00:18:53.110
When struck, you feel anger.

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:54.980
When stabbed, you feel pain.

00:18:55.350 --> 00:18:57.950
When wounded, you cry that 
you don't want to die.

00:18:57.950 --> 00:19:00.860
When you lose your family, 
you swear revenge.

00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:04.120
When you fall ill, you moan.

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:07.500
When hungry, you loathe and 
envy those with plenty.

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:13.570
What is the most effective way to create 
many people of that nature at once?

00:19:13.570 --> 00:19:14.800
That's...

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:16.210
War.

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:17.500
Precisely.

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:21.310
I once created a device to 
absorb feelings from people.

00:19:21.810 --> 00:19:23.970
To increase coverage over 
the entire continent,

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:27.400
I launched dozens of them 
high into the skies.

00:19:27.830 --> 00:19:30.190
Devices to absorb feelings? He can't mean...

00:19:30.510 --> 00:19:31.690
The "overnight castles"!

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:37.270
I wish for nothing but to absorb 
the thoughts and feelings of all

00:19:37.270 --> 00:19:39.400
living things on the continent.

00:19:40.180 --> 00:19:45.330
From this day on, I will forever 
live to fulfill all of your wishes.

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:51.450
I will bring endless war to 
all of you who desire battle.

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:53.170
Rend.

00:20:01.390 --> 00:20:04.180
Niva Lada, my wand.

00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:09.430
Appear, my sacred treasure.

00:20:15.550 --> 00:20:17.230
A trivial task.

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:19.670
Without even setting foot from here,

00:20:19.670 --> 00:20:22.720
I will leave no trace of the 
attackers coming my way.

00:20:24.440 --> 00:20:25.560
Disappear.

00:20:43.570 --> 00:20:45.720
A fitting firearm salute, indeed.

00:20:47.920 --> 00:20:50.780
It will soon become clear 
that you are the enemy.

00:20:51.300 --> 00:20:54.780
Do you still believe you can start 
another war with the allied army?

00:20:55.170 --> 00:20:58.190
The allied army is not a monolith.

00:20:59.010 --> 00:21:04.610
All humans desire war deep 
within their hearts.

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:07.640
I have only fired the opening shot.

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:10.990
Those who wish for war 
will embrace this chance

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:12.970
and take up their weapons.

00:21:13.840 --> 00:21:18.380
My wand, bring me my new castle.

00:21:22.830 --> 00:21:25.190
<i>Target floating fortress located.</i>

00:21:25.670 --> 00:21:27.010
<i>Commencing operation.</i>

00:23:25.850 --> 00:23:27.170
Father revived!

00:23:27.170 --> 00:23:29.080
Definitely shocking truth!

00:23:29.080 --> 00:23:31.020
What is Father's intention?!

00:23:31.020 --> 00:23:34.050
What fate of Toru, Akari, Fredrica, me?

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:36.090
Must do what?

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:40.180
The Girl Who Carries the Gundo

00:23:36.860 --> 00:23:40.190
Next time, the final episode: 
"The Girl Who Carries the Gundo."
